[I] C++ library for modeling and describing complex hardware systems

[T] SystemC addresses the need for a system design and verification language
[T] that spans hardware and software. It is a language built as an ANSI C++
[T] class library created for design and verification.

[U] https://www.accellera.org/downloads/standards/systemc

